  "remaining_limits": [
    "The Text.Checksum compatibility facade still includes CRC-32 embedded assembly unsupported by the native frontend; standalone Text.Crc64 is independently validated.",
    "The self-built backend retains documented public wide-primitive object, wide closure and wide tail-group restrictions. CRC-64 uses private wide SIMD pair helpers and word-sized loop boundaries.",
